      "cooked": "<p>This is not nearly as bonkers as some of the win combos I've seen posted here, but it made me giggle, so I thought I'd mention it.&nbsp; I was battling Mad Bomber Blade in Zhu's temple.&nbsp; DW Nightmist plays Oblivion and hits two 4's, uses Amulet to redirect to blade, and wipes three shinobi assasins.&nbsp; The 12 damage from Oblivion makes blade the lowest-hp target, so I put all three assasins on Nightmist's deck, and use attunemet to deal 9 more ftw.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:11.003Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
